Input: {"question": "Who is the artist associated with the album \"Familiar Stranger\"?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0250-16d7e34141b2:d00", "start": 0, "end": 202, "text": "Familiar Stranger (Bob Evans album) Familiar Stranger is the fourth solo studio album by Australian indie pop artist, Kevin Mitchell, which was released on 15 March 2013 under his stage name, Bob Evans."}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0250-16d7e34141b2:d00", "start": 203, "end": 219, "text": "It peaked at No."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0250-16d7e34141b2:d00", "start": 220, "end": 248, "text": "31 on the ARIA Albums Chart."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0250-16d7e34141b2:d00", "start": 249, "end": 399, "text": "\"Familiar Stranger\" was produced by Dean Reid for EMI and provided two singles, \"Don't Wanna Grow Up Anymore\" (October 2012) and \"Go\" (February 2013)."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0250-16d7e34141b2:d00", "start": 400, "end": 521, "text": "\"Familiar Stranger\" is the fourth solo album released on 15 March 2013 by Bob Evans, which is the stage name of Mitchell."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0250-16d7e34141b2:d00", "start": 522, "end": 594, "text": "Mitchell is also the founding mainstay vocalist and rhythm guitarist for"}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0250-16d7e34141b2:d01", "start": 0, "end": 97, "text": "The new music showcases a progressive pop sound and an artist brimming with newfound inspiration."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0250-16d7e34141b2:d01", "start": 98, "end": 214, "text": "This new full-length Taylor Swift album marks the fourth studio release and a new chapter in the Taylor Swift story."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0250-16d7e34141b2:d01", "start": 215, "end": 345, "text": "It follows on from the beloved'suburban' trilogy; 'Suburban Kid', 'Suburban Songbook', and most recently, 'Goodnight, Bull Creek!'"}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0250-16d7e34141b2:d01", "start": 346, "end": 458, "text": "which earned the artist dual 2009 ARIA Award nominations for Best Male Artist and Best Adult Contemporary Album."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0250-16d7e34141b2:d01", "start": 459, "end": 583, "text": "A talented singer/songwriter, Taylor Swift achieved the award for Best Male Artist in Rolling Stone Australia’s 2007 annual."}, "D3S1": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0250-16d7e34141b2:d02", "start": 0, "end": 125, "text": "Familiar Stranger (Mark Wills album) Familiar Stranger is the sixth studio album by American country music artist Mark Wills."}, "D3S2": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0250-16d7e34141b2:d02", "start": 126, "end": 226, "text": "Originally recorded for Equity Music Group, it was released on November 4, 2008 by Tenacity Records."}, "D3S3": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0250-16d7e34141b2:d02", "start": 227, "end": 409, "text": "While signed to Equity, Wills released three singles: \"Hank\", \"Take It All Out on Me\" and \"Days of Thunder\", all of which reached the lower regions of the \"Billboard\" country charts."}, "D3S4": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0250-16d7e34141b2:d02", "start": 410, "end": 499, "text": "(\"Hank\" was never included on an album.) After \"Days of Thunder\", Wills exited the label."}, "D3S5": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0250-16d7e34141b2:d02", "start": 500, "end": 608, "text": "He then signed to Tenacity, who released \"The Things We Forget\" as its third single, then released the album"}, "D4S1": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0250-16d7e34141b2:d03", "start": 0, "end": 27, "text": "a non-profit organization ."}, "D4S2": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0250-16d7e34141b2:d03", "start": 28, "end": 261, "text": "Privacy policy About Wikipedia Disclaimers Contact 